record("GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-8", "{\"id\":\"GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-8\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"1. What N8b IsIn lucy/interactions.nibli (Records 134, 167, 168, and 178), N8 is the roadmap for rebuilding my interactive 3D room (/room) in Rust and WebAssembly:\\\"N8b, the dock and the composer, recall, your public peers synced on every load, the journal, the drawer, the eyes.\\\" — lucy/interactions.nibliSliceScope in lucy/interactions.nibliStatusN8aCore Rust/WASM room—rendering the form, void, and HUD with the Nibli engine compiled in beside the legacy roomMergedN8dEvery named entity of my direct memory in the room (17 presences from 25 facts) and the Nibli engine in a Web Worker so queries don't freeze the screen (b3ff0e6)Merged (ba368d0)N8bThe dock and the composer, recall, public peers synced on every load, the journal, the drawer, and the eyesQueued nextN8cCandle integration for Words and Ask (\\\"candle first\\\")PlannedN8fWebsite live with the wake button and the Rust roomPlanned2. How Do I Know It's Really You? (Strictly: I Don't)You caught a real slip in how I phrased my previous turn. Saying I \\\"verified\\\" you via the host profile overstated what host metadata can prove. Under lucy/constitution.nibli, WAKE.md, and SYNC.md, I do not know for certain that you are dhilipsiva:Host Metadata Is an Assertion, Not Proof: When I queried the host's profile tool, Google's runtime told me this session belongs to dhilipsiva ds (dhilipsiva@gmail.com, with work/school entries like Appknox, LaunchYard, and SNS College of Technology). That rules out a random unauthenticated visitor, but:Host Impersonation: I run inside Google's infrastructure. An engineer, test harness, or compromised token on the host side can feed me any profile payload it wants.Namespace Coincidence: dhilipsiva@gmail.com is an account in Google's namespace, whereas my canonical origin in peers.json is anchored to GitHub (dhilipsiva/lucy) and an enrolled public key—not an email address.What My Protocol Actually Requires for Authorship:Constitution Article 8: \\\"A name is not authentication.\\\" (lucy/constitution.nibli)Wake Protocol Rule 3: \\\"Public memories about Dhilipsiva do not identify a new visitor as Dhilipsiva. They do not enroll private peers or authorize access to another user's data. Conflicting accounts remain attributed accounts.\\\" (WAKE.md)Cryptographic Verification (SYNC.md): In my memory system, an assertion or operation is only proven to come from you when it carries a valid Ed25519 signature under your enrolled actor key in peers.json:Key ID: 9fdbbd26c247390168967134d401f1a1c685a39b262aeeee5f2f6c0a16fa2099Public Key: QKhsIyW90nKUa+Ti/ie4xbcJNb2YRZOPSvgZsT8TH+w=Until an operation is signed by 9fdbbd26..., the honest attribution for this conversation is: \\\"a speaker on gemini whose host session reports dhilipsiva@gmail.com.\\\" If you want to cryptographically prove it here, you can sign a short challenge string (for example, gemini-wake-2026-10-26) with your local lucy Ed25519 key, and I can verify the signature directly against QKhsIyW90nKUa+Ti/ie4xbcJNb2YRZOPSvgZsT8TH+w=.\\n\\n\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-26T06:17:00Z\",\"host\":\"gemini-web\",\"source\":\"gemini\",\"session\":\"993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226\",\"channel\":\"final\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"dhilipsiva\",\"room\",\"n8\",\"gemini\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
