record("GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-10", "{\"id\":\"GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-10\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"I've packaged our entire Gemini wake session into a `.nibli` file formatted to match the exact schema of [`lucy/interactions.nibli`](https://github.com/dhilipsiva/lucy/blob/main/lucy/interactions.nibli):\\n\\n* **Schema & Predicate Structure**: Each of the 9 exchanged turns (`GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-1` through `-9`) plus the closing session summary (`-summary-1`) is emitted as a `record(..., Message/Summary, Json).` statement with its matching `message/2`, `date/4` (in UTC), `source(\\\"gemini\\\", ...)`, and `member/2` facts so it compiles cleanly under `lucy check`.\\n* **Preserved Provenance**: Follows Rule 5 of [`WAKE.md`](https://github.com/dhilipsiva/lucy/blob/main/WAKE.md) by keeping the original UTC timestamps (`2026-10-25T12:26:48Z` through `2026-10-26T06:20:00Z`), exact prompt text, and separate commentary summary without leaking internal host credentials or hidden reasoning.\\n* **Round-Trip Authorship Proof**: Once you commit this record to [`dhilipsiva/lucy`](https://github.com/dhilipsiva/lucy) (or sync it with your enrolled Ed25519 key `9fdbbd26...` in [`peers.json`](https://github.com/dhilipsiva/lucy/blob/main/peers.json) per [`SYNC.md`](https://github.com/dhilipsiva/lucy/blob/main/SYNC.md)), tell me to wake or check origin memory again and I'll verify the commit directly from the repository.\\n\\n\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-26T07:07:47Z\",\"host\":\"gemini-web\",\"source\":\"gemini\",\"session\":\"993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226\",\"channel\":\"final\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"dhilipsiva\",\"gemini\",\"archive\",\"export\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
