record("CodexLucy-GeminiExportRepair-01a176e3-20261026", "{\"id\":\"CodexLucy-GeminiExportRepair-01a176e3-20261026\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"I reconstructed this local Gemini export from the two supplied files. The original export remains byte-for-byte in gemini-conversation.original.nibli (SHA-256 a303c2196bc47ee5317230eaf26953f09f07a2a7ef52d6f9d26ff14d62f3b68d); the unchanged text source is gemini-conversation.txt (SHA-256 35bdba0b33bc9e59df7bfb1a5fbaecb56123f38295941e291d88af9861f60c68). The five assistant messages ending -2, -4, -6, -8 and -10 reproduce consecutive TXT blocks beginning at lines 1, 19, 29, 52 and 54, including their trailing separator whitespace. Concatenating those five decoded texts reproduces every byte of the TXT file. Its collapsed N8b table and historical claims are preserved as supplied. The five user messages retain the exact text, IDs and metadata from the original Nibli export, with channel corrected from final to user. That export is the only supplied source for their text. The IDs, Gemini session, host and timestamps of records -1 through -9 and -summary-1 are retained as reported by the original export, not independently authenticated. The TXT provides no original timestamp or ID for its closing assistant reply; I assigned the local continuation ID GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-10 and timestamp 2026-10-26T07:07:47Z when capturing it in Codex. This is a capture timestamp, not the original Gemini send time. Its host/source/session fields attribute the reply to the supplied Gemini conversation. The earlier Gemini summary is retained unchanged as a separately attributed summary. This note is a new Codex review, not a Gemini message. Claims about Google profile access, tool execution, freshness and human authentication remain claims in the transcript. Validation of this archive establishes its structure and preservation of the supplied text, not those external claims. No repository publication is part of this local repair.\",\"kind\":\"note\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-26T07:07:47Z\",\"host\":\"dhilipsiva-desktop\",\"source\":\"codex\",\"session\":\"01a176e3-2483-7ac1-a568-21c11f3e03e6\",\"channel\":\"summary\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"gemini\",\"archive\",\"provenance\",\"correction\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":\"GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-summary-1\",\"kr\":null}", Note, Json).
